    {
        "content": "<p>Please read more carefully \"I would think that we could repurpose <code>ChainComplex.ofHom</code> to make it a constructor for morphisms between <strong>arbitrary chain complexes</strong>, with parameters the morphisms in each degree and the commutation with <code>d n (n + 1)</code>\"</p>",
